COPY public.findings (id, scan_id, type, category, owasp_category, url, method, parameter, severity, confidence, evidence, description, impact, remediation, "timestamp") FROM stdin;
a835876f-f12a-44cf-955d-0dbf439d8cef	3930e914-e046-473e-8898-0fb218a17323	Missing Security Header	Security Misconfiguration	A05:2021 - Security Misconfiguration	https://lms.eng.sjp.ac.lk/	GET	\N	MEDIUM	CONFIRMED	Response did not include a 'content-security-policy' header.	Content-Security-Policy is missing, allowing a wider range of injection attacks (e.g. XSS) to succeed.	Increases exposure to related client-side attacks (clickjacking, XSS, MIME confusion, referrer leakage).	Define a restrictive Content-Security-Policy (e.g. default-src 'self') and tighten it per resource type.	2026-10-29 06:15:39.277586
57854031-6316-4a91-9ea9-5ce8da65a0a7	3930e914-e046-473e-8898-0fb218a17323	Missing Security Header	Security Misconfiguration	A05:2021 - Security Misconfiguration	https://lms.eng.sjp.ac.lk/	GET	\N	LOW	CONFIRMED	Response did not include a 'strict-transport-security' header.	Strict-Transport-Security (HSTS) is missing, so the site does not instruct browsers to enforce HTTPS.	Increases exposure to related client-side attacks (clickjacking, XSS, MIME confusion, referrer leakage).	Add Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains once HTTPS is fully deployed.	2026-10-29 06:15:39.277598
942faeb9-fd50-40e8-829e-32c78b2e784b	3930e914-e046-473e-8898-0fb218a17323	Missing Security Header	Security Misconfiguration	A05:2021 - Security Misconfiguration	https://lms.eng.sjp.ac.lk/	GET	\N	LOW	CONFIRMED	Response did not include a 'x-content-type-options' header.	X-Content-Type-Options is missing, allowing browsers to MIME-sniff responses.	Increases exposure to related client-side attacks (clickjacking, XSS, MIME confusion, referrer leakage).	Add X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff to all responses.	2026-10-29 06:15:39.277605
7bf42ca0-e1bf-44b9-b41e-bb96cb1d5584	3930e914-e046-473e-8898-0fb218a17323	Missing Security Header	Security Misconfiguration	A05:2021 - Security Misconfiguration	https://lms.eng.sjp.ac.lk/	GET	\N	MEDIUM	CONFIRMED	Response did not include a 'x-frame-options' header.	X-Frame-Options is missing, which may allow the page to be framed for clickjacking.	Increases exposure to related client-side attacks (clickjacking, XSS, MIME confusion, referrer leakage).	Add X-Frame-Options: DENY or SAMEORIGIN, or an equivalent frame-ancestors CSP directive.	2026-10-29 06:15:39.277611
552f76f6-877b-42d6-9a7b-00f1d59c6048	3930e914-e046-473e-8898-0fb218a17323	Missing Security Header	Security Misconfiguration	A05:2021 - Security Misconfiguration	https://lms.eng.sjp.ac.lk/	GET	\N	LOW	CONFIRMED	Response did not include a 'referrer-policy' header.	Referrer-Policy is missing, which may leak full URLs (including sensitive query strings) to third parties via the Referer header.	Increases exposure to related client-side attacks (clickjacking, XSS, MIME confusion, referrer leakage).	Add a Referrer-Policy such as strict-origin-when-cross-origin.	2026-10-29 06:15:39.277617
4d477284-d7f5-4f14-85ca-326ff33047bd	3930e914-e046-473e-8898-0fb218a17323	Missing Security Header	Security Misconfiguration	A05:2021 - Security Misconfiguration	https://lms.eng.sjp.ac.lk/	GET	\N	INFORMATIONAL	CONFIRMED	Response did not include a 'permissions-policy' header.	Permissions-Policy is missing, so the site does not explicitly restrict access to powerful browser features.	Increases exposure to related client-side attacks (clickjacking, XSS, MIME confusion, referrer leakage).	Add a Permissions-Policy header restricting features (camera, microphone, geolocation, etc.) that are not needed.	2026-10-29 06:15:39.277623
d5d93f3d-9bde-4c21-9e5f-c0d9b4e2a7f8	3930e914-e046-473e-8898-0fb218a17323	Insecure Cookie Configuration	Security Misconfiguration	A05:2021 - Security Misconfiguration	https://lms.eng.sjp.ac.lk/	GET	\N	HIGH	CONFIRMED	Cookie 'MoodleSession' is missing attribute(s): Secure, HttpOnly, SameSite.	Cookies without Secure/HttpOnly/SameSite are more exposed to interception, client-side script access, and cross-site request forgery respectively.	Session or state cookies could be exposed to XSS-based theft, network interception, or CSRF.	Set Secure, HttpOnly, and an appropriate SameSite value on all session/state cookies.	2026-10-29 06:15:39.27763
54287938-3942-442e-b4fd-455be82b5a2e	3930e914-e046-473e-8898-0fb218a17323	Technology Detection	Information Disclosure	A05:2021 - Security Misconfiguration	https://lms.eng.sjp.ac.lk/	GET	\N	INFORMATIONAL	INFORMATIONAL	server: Apache/2.4.6 (CentOS) OpenSSL/1.0.2k-fips mod_fcgid/2.3.9 PHP/7.4.33	Server/technology banner is exposed via response headers. This is fingerprinting information, not a vulnerability by itself.	May help an attacker prioritize known vulnerabilities for the identified software version.	Consider suppressing or genericizing version-revealing headers where feasible.	2026-10-29 06:15:39.277636
